         <<var;name="bullet";original="2.";match=".{0,20}">> loading, displaying, running, or storing the Software on any or all medium.

         <<var;name="bullet";original="3.";match=".{0,20}">> entitlement to observe, study or test its operation so as to determine the ideas and principles behind any or all constituent elements of said Software. This shall apply when the Licensee carries out any or all loading, displaying, running, transmission or storage operation as regards the Software, that it is entitled to carry out hereunder.

      <<var;name="bullet";original="5.2";match=".{0,20}">> ENTITLEMENT TO MAKE CONTRIBUTIONS

